        <mxCell id="c84" value="Posting to the ledger" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="242" y="790" width="180" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c85" value="&lt;i&gt;The model answer&#x27;s marking, from the Cycle Map and Risks sheets: 8 control points are evidenced in part (C3 among them, since the freight policy for partial returns and a criterion for the tax lie outside the records), and 1 (C8) rests mostly on evidence in no table. The badge style carries the reading with its fill and its outline, not its color alone. Departments are the cost centers of the people each document names.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="822" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
